  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides funding for Australia&apos;s bilateral support to the Tuvalu Health Sector. This includes activity to deploy medical specialists through the Pacific Community (SPC), digital health improvements, and support for the Government of Tuvalu with the costs of a locum surgeon.</narrative>
